{"candidateAnswer":"United Kingdom","evidence":"[D1:18 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] Tim: I went to a place in London a few years ago - it was like walking into a Harry Potter movie! I also went on a tour which was amazing. Have you been to any of the real Potter places? I'd love to explore them someday!\n[D13:1 | 1:50 pm on 13 October, 2023] Tim: Hey John! It's been ages since we last talked. Guess what? Last week I went to a Harry Potter conference in the UK - it was incredible! There were so many people who shared the same love of HP as me, it was like a magical family. I felt so inspired and like I got a new lease of life. I love how my passion for fantasy stuff brings me closer to people from all over the world, it's pretty cool.\n[D18:1 | 3:59 pm on 16 November, 2023] Tim: Hey John! Hope you're doing good. Guess what? I went to a castle during my trip to the UK last Friday and it was unbelievable! The architecture and the history were amazing!","itemId":"urn:uuid:a0530485-aa0a-5f2a-99dd-75e50e647e3a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2b49789b2ebc3ca1c9e82b5c1b77811b55fddda040fefd3ce38a2697b1062721","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"which country has Tim visited most frequently in his travels?","referenceAnswer":"UK","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2b49789b2ebc3ca1c9e82b5c1b77811b55fddda040fefd3ce38a2697b1062721"}}]}